"file_name": "5.png", "id": "320300157529436", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_320300160862769_8131700945978593410_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y5ZHGFzzHFQQ7kNvwFBJyQg&_nc_oc=AdpYj72E7v6P6NOtCZH_RI6rVggrHTj6JLmSnbnFiAEZAlH3vpRFsC4w5rSDyIR_FTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAdKJvSPU1DvJMjgskZhLucKbuf6l3q2auVmW3Q2JroVw&oe=6A4D1993"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Action Resort XR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dive into the ultimate XR experience with Action Resort XR! Unleash your fists in our boxing simulations, refine your reflexes in high-velocity games, or channel your inner chef in a chaotic virtual kitchen. It's not just about gaming; it's a total body-and-mind adventure.\n\nConsider this collection a must-have for any XR enthusiast. We've carefully curated a blend of games that enhance both your mental acuity and physical well-being, all while delivering a fun-packed experience with top-tier visuals.\n\nLaunch Modes to Look Forward To:\n\u2022 Pro Boxing Training: Get in the ring with your highly customizable coach (m/f) and rise through the ranks, from amateur to pro \u2013 and beyond!\n\n\u2022 Smoothie Bar: Don your chef hat in our virtual kitchen; chop veggies, peel fruits, and blend up some wellness!\n\n\u2022 Ball Smasher Reflex Training: Hone your reflexes by taking on rapid-fire pitching machines. It's a workout for mind and muscle!\n\n\u2022 Food Fight: Take all your rage out on Bots such as the Banana or the Pizza Slice; Brace yourself for the sweatiest, most exhilarating session you'll ever have in XR!\n\nEmbrace a healthier, more active you with Action Resort XR. Our activities offer more than just fun\u2014they deliver a holistic wellness journey that seamlessly integrates into your daily life. Enjoy health benefits from cardiovascular wellness to mental sharpness!", "short_description": "Action-packed fitness in XR! Swing, punch, and play your way to health and happiness."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fitnesscloud.eu/privacyPolicy.htm", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://fitnesscloud.eu/eula.htm", "publisher_name": "Verseus Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.verseus-games.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6737088016413144"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 9, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2386681935214579"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27568817646139086"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1678990313477148"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1213501876954669"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "966101972264174"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "589528400202701"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1016552106885111"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "878784340789424"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "727333112789362"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1016552106885111"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1786726800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2386681935214579"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9799299933525255", "version": "0.4.84"}, "id": "957956138803419", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{